    "This email already has a Deepglot account. Sign in with that account, then open this invite link again to accept it.": "Ova e-pošta već ima Deepglot račun. Prijavite se s tim računom, a zatim ponovno otvorite ovu vezu s pozivnicom da biste je prihvatili.",
