    "Receive one email on Monday with the previous complete week's new translations, manual edits, and translation requests. Quiet weeks are skipped.": "Modtag én e-mail om mandagen med den foregående komplette uges nye oversættelser, manuelle redigeringer og oversættelsesanmodninger. Stille uger springes over.",
