    "This link is valid for 7 days. If you did not expect this invitation, you can ignore this email.": "Dette link er gyldigt i 7 dage. Hvis du ikke forventede denne invitation, kan du ignorere denne e-mail.",
    "This notice explains how Deepglot processes personal data for accounts, translation projects, integrations, support, security, and billing. Last updated: 25 August 2026.": "Denne meddelelse forklarer, hvordan Deepglot behandler personlige data til konti, oversættelsesprojekter, integrationer, support, sikkerhed og fakturering. Sidst opdateret: 25. august 2026.",
