    "This email address is already registered": "See e-posti aadress on juba registreeritud",
    "This email already has a Deepglot account. Sign in with that account, then open this invite link again to accept it.": "Sellel meilil on juba Deepgloti konto. Logige sisse selle kontoga, seejärel avage see kutselink uuesti, et see vastu võtta.",
