    "Dashboard navigation": "Nascleanúint painéal",
    "Dashboard warnings at 90% and 100% of your monthly words, a proactive email to the organization owner, and a WordPress admin notice — you know before translations pause, not after.": "Rabhadh ar an bpainéal ag 90% agus 100% de d’fhocail mhíosúla, ríomhphost réamhghníomhach chuig úinéir na heagraíochta, agus fógra riaracháin WordPress - tá a fhios agat sula gcuirtear na haistriúcháin ar sos, ní ina dhiaidh sin.",
    "Date": "Dáta",
    "Dedicated contract (DPA)": "Conradh tiomnaithe (DPA)",
    "Deepglot": "Deepglot",
    "Deepglot combines low-cost LLMs with optional premium providers while your data stays under your control.": "Nascann Deepglot LLManna ar chostas íseal le soláthraithe préimhe roghnacha fad a fhanann do shonraí faoi do smacht.",
    "Deepglot currently uses your Gravatar. Direct uploads are not available yet.": "Úsáideann Deepglot do Gravatar faoi láthair. Níl uaslódálacha díreacha ar fáil go fóill.",
    "Deepglot gives you control over your translations again, with professional features at fair prices.": "Tugann Deepglot smacht duit ar do chuid aistriúcháin arís, le gnéithe gairmiúla ar phraghsanna cothroma.",
    "Deepglot is a software service for website translation, project administration, and WordPress integration. Self-hosted operation is also supported under the applicable software and third-party licence terms.": "Is seirbhís bogearraí é Deepglot le haghaidh aistriúchán láithreán gréasáin, riarachán tionscadail agus comhtháthú WordPress. Tacaítear le hoibríocht fhéin-óstach freisin faoi na téarmaí bogearraí is infheidhme agus ceadúnais tríú páirtí.",
    "Deepglot is designed around that premise: translations stay accessible to the project, can be exported, and can be served from the WordPress integration without turning every page view into a new translation purchase.": "Tá Deepglot deartha thart ar an mbonn sin: fanann na haistriúcháin inrochtana don tionscadal, is féidir iad a easpórtáil, agus is féidir iad a sheirbheáil ó chomhtháthú WordPress gan gach amharc leathanaigh a thiontú ina cheannach aistriúcháin nua.",
    "Deepglot is developed in Austria. That origin now has a visible place in the product: direct language, precise interfaces, a warm architectural image, and a signal orange that is distinctly its own.": "Forbraítear Deepglot san Ostair. Tá áit infheicthe ag an mbunús sin sa táirge anois: teanga dhíreach, comhéadain bheacht, íomhá te ailtireachta, agus oráiste comhartha a bhfuil a chuid féin ar leith aige.",
    "Deepglot provides project configuration, translation caching, glossaries, import and export, webhooks, visual editing, and WordPress runtime integration. Machine translation can be incomplete or inaccurate. You must review translations before using them for legal, medical, safety-critical, regulated, or other high-risk purposes. We may maintain, update, or replace technical components while preserving the agreed core service.": "Soláthraíonn Deepglot cumraíocht tionscadail, taisce aistriúcháin, gluaiseanna, allmhairiú agus onnmhairiú, cuacha gréasáin, eagarthóireacht amhairc, agus comhtháthú ama rite WordPress. Is féidir le haistriúchán meaisín a bheith neamhiomlán nó míchruinn. Ní mór duit aistriúcháin a athbhreithniú sula n-úsáideann tú iad chun críocha dlíthiúla, leighis, criticiúla sábháilteachta, rialaithe nó eile a mbaineann riosca ard leo. Féadfaimid comhpháirteanna teicniúla a chothabháil, a nuashonrú nó a athsholáthar agus an croísheirbhís comhaontaithe á caomhnú againn.",
    "Deepglot signs every delivery with a timestamp and HMAC signature.": "Síníonn Deepglot gach seachadadh le stampa ama agus síniú HMAC.",
    "Deepglot support is available Monday to Friday from 9 a.m. to 5 p.m.": "Tá tacaíocht Deepglot ar fáil ó Luan go hAoine ó 9 r.n. go 5 i.n.",
    "Deepglot supports a self-hosted deployment path to reduce cloud lock-in. Unless a separate managed-services agreement applies, the self-hosting operator is responsible for infrastructure, database, backups, security updates, email, payment and translation-provider configuration, lawful processing, and third-party charges. Availability or support for third-party and self-hosted systems is not part of the hosted subscription merely because integration documentation is provided.": "Tacaíonn Deepglot le cosán imlonnaithe féin-óstáilte chun glasáil isteach scamall a laghdú. Mura bhfuil comhaontú seirbhísí bainistithe ar leith i bhfeidhm, tá an t-oibreoir féin-óstála freagrach as bonneagar, bunachair shonraí, cúltacaí, nuashonruithe slándála, ríomhphost, cumraíocht sholáthraí íocaíochta agus aistriúcháin, próiseáil dhleathach, agus muirir tríú páirtí. Níl infhaighteacht nó tacaíocht do chórais tríú páirtí agus féin-óstáilte mar chuid den síntiús óstaithe amháin toisc go gcuirtear doiciméadú comhtháthaithe ar fáil.",
    "Deepglot translates your WordPress content automatically with AI at a fraction of the usual cost. Your translations stay yours.": "Aistríonn Deepglot d’ábhar WordPress go huathoibríoch le AI ar chodán den ghnáthchostas. Is leatsa na haistriúcháin.",
    "DeepL translation API. No model id is needed.": "API aistriúcháin DeepL. Níl aon samhail aitheantais ag teastáil.",
    "Default: gpt-5-mini for best cost/quality. Pro/flagship models like gpt-5.5 are opt-in.": "Réamhshocrú: gpt-5-mini don chostas / cáilíocht is fearr. Is rogha an diúltaithe iad samhlacha pro/suaitheanta cosúil le gpt-5.5.",
