    "Reset your password": "Athshocraigh do phasfhocal",
    "Retranslate and delete actions are not available here yet. Open the URL to inspect the current site output.": "Níl gníomhartha ath-aistrithe agus scrios ar fáil anseo fós. Oscail an URL chun aschur reatha an tsuímh a iniúchadh.",
    "Return": "Fill ar ais",
    "Returns normalized translation exclusions, collision-safe translated URL slugs, and the synchronization timestamp used by the WordPress runtime.": "Filleann sé eisiamh aistriúcháin normalaithe, slugaí URL aistrithe sábháilte ó imbhuailtí, agus an stampa ama sioncronaithe a úsáideann am rite WordPress.",
    "Review your": "Déan athbhreithniú ar do",
    "Role": "Ról",
    "Rotate secret": "Rothlaigh an rún",
    "Routing & domains": "Ródú & fearainn",
    "Run the full backend yourself with Docker when you need maximum data ownership and cost control.": "Rith an t-inneall iomlán duit féin le Docker nuair a bhíonn uas-úinéireacht sonraí agus rialú costais uait.",
    "SAML SSO": "SAML SSO",
    "Save": "Sábháil",
    "Save settings": "Sábháil socruithe",
    "Save translations to the database automatically": "Sábháil aistriúcháin go huathoibríoch chuig an mbunachar sonraí",
    "Saving...": "Ag sábháil...",
    "Search": "Cuardach",
    "Search exclusions...": "Eisiaimh cuardaigh...",
    "Search project": "Tionscadal cuardaigh",
    "Search requests are handled in the visitor's current language.": "Déantar iarratais chuardaigh a láimhseáil i dteanga reatha an chuairteora.",
    "Search slug...": "Cuardaigh seilide...",
    "Search text...": "Cuardaigh téacs...",
