    "WordPress engineering": "Innealtóireacht WordPress",
    "WordPress is the source of truth for runtime settings": "Is é WordPress foinse na fírinne le haghaidh socruithe am rite",
    "WordPress plugin": "Breiseán WordPress",
    "WordPress Plugin": "Breiseán WordPress",
    "WordPress settings": "Socruithe WordPress",
    "WordPress translation without subscription lock-in": "Aistriúchán WordPress gan síntiús a ghlasáil isteach",
    "WordPress-first plugin": "WordPress-an chéad breiseán",
    "Words": "Focail",
    "words / month": "focail / mí",
    "Workspace": "Spás oibre",
    "Workspace creation and management will appear here once persistence for those actions is implemented.": "Beidh cruthú agus bainistiú spásanna oibre le feiceáil anseo a luaithe a bheidh na gníomhaíochtaí sin curtha i bhfeidhm.",
    "Workspace default": "Réamhshocrú spás oibre",
    "Wrong email address or password": "Seoladh ríomhphoist nó pasfhocal mícheart",
    "Yearly": "Bliantúil",
    "You can cancel a paid subscription through the available cancellation control or Stripe billing portal. Cancellation is scheduled for the end of the current paid billing period; the paid plan normally remains active until then. Statutory cancellation, withdrawal, and refund rights remain unaffected. Cancelling a subscription does not itself delete the account or project data. Export required data before deleting a project or account and contact support if the in-product flow is unavailable.": "Is féidir leat síntiús íoctha a chealú tríd an rialú cealaithe atá ar fáil nó tríd an tairseach billeála Stripe. Tá cealú sceidealta do dheireadh na tréimhse billeála íoctha reatha; de ghnáth fanann an plean íoctha gníomhach go dtí sin. Níl aon tionchar fós ar chealú reachtúil, ar tharraingt siar agus ar chearta aisíocaíochta. Má chuirtear síntiús ar ceal, ní scriostar sonraí an chuntais nó an tionscadail. Easpórtáil sonraí riachtanacha roimh scriosadh tionscadal nó cuntas agus déan teagmháil le tacaíocht mura bhfuil an sreabhadh intáirge ar fáil.",
    "You have been invited to collaborate on a Deepglot project.": "Tugadh cuireadh duit a bheith ag comhoibriú ar thionscadal Deepglot.",
    "You must provide accurate registration information, keep credentials and API keys secure, and use the service only for lawful content for which you hold the necessary rights. You are responsible for users, websites, webhook destinations, and provider credentials connected to your organization. Automated abuse, attempts to bypass quotas or rate limits, and interference with the service are prohibited.": "Ní mór duit faisnéis chlárúcháin chruinn a sholáthar, dintiúir agus eochracha API a choinneáil slán, agus an tseirbhís a úsáid ach amháin le haghaidh ábhar dleathach a bhfuil na cearta riachtanacha agat ina leith. Tá tú freagrach as úsáideoirí, suíomhanna gréasáin, cinn scríbe cúnta gréasáin, agus dintiúir soláthraithe atá nasctha le d’eagraíocht. Tá cosc ​​ar mhí-úsáid uathoibrithe, iarrachtaí cuótaí nó teorainneacha rátaí a sheachbhóthar, agus cur isteach ar an tseirbhís.",
    "You receive this email because the weekly digest is enabled for this workspace.": "Faigheann tú an ríomhphost seo toisc go bhfuil an achoimre seachtainiúil cumasaithe don spás oibre seo.",
    "You requested to reset your Deepglot password.": "D'iarr tú do phasfhocal Deepglot a athshocrú.",
    "You retain rights in content submitted to Deepglot and grant us the limited permission needed to process, store, translate, transmit, and return it for the service. Depending on project settings, translation content is sent to the selected translation provider or customer-specified compatible endpoint. You must ensure that this processing and any uploaded provider API key are permitted for your content and users.": "Coinníonn tú cearta in ábhar a chuirtear isteach chuig Deepglot agus tugann tú an cead teoranta dúinn atá ag teastáil chun é a phróiseáil, a stóráil, a aistriú, a tharchur agus a sheoladh ar ais don tseirbhís. Ag brath ar shocruithe an tionscadail, seoltar ábhar aistriúcháin chuig an soláthraí aistriúcháin roghnaithe nó críochphointe comhoiriúnach atá sonraithe ag an gcustaiméir. Ní mór duit a chinntiú go gceadaítear an phróiseáil seo agus aon eochair API soláthraí uaslódáilte do d’inneachar agus d’úsáideoirí.",
    "you@example.com": "tusa@sampla.com",
    "Your current plan is:": "Is é do phlean reatha:",
    "Your data, your control": "Do shonraí, do rialú",
    "Your Deepglot weekly digest – {organization}": "Do Deepglot achoimre sheachtainiúil – {organization}",
    "Your languages. Your content. Your control.": "Do theangacha. D'ábhar. Do smacht.",
    "Your plan will remain active until the end of the current billing period. After that, you will be moved back to the Free plan.": "Fanfaidh do phlean gníomhach go dtí deireadh na tréimhse billeála reatha. Ina dhiaidh sin, bogfar ar ais chuig an bplean In Aisce thú."
