    "Choose which URLs or HTML blocks are not translated. The WordPress plugin syncs these rules automatically.": "Pasirinkite, kurie URL ar HTML blokai nebus verčiami. „WordPress“ papildinys šias taisykles sinchronizuoja automatiškai.",
