    "2FA needs a dedicated enrollment and recovery flow. This setting cannot be changed until that work is implemented.": "2FA teħtieġ fluss dedikat ta' reġistrazzjoni u rkupru. Dan is-setting ma jistax jinbidel sakemm dak ix-xogħol jiġi implimentat.",
