    "A clear place of origin": "Post ta' oriġini ċar",
    "A multilingual website becomes part of a company’s core publishing infrastructure. Its translations, localized URLs, glossary decisions, and search visibility should not disappear when a subscription changes.": "Websajt multilingwi ssir parti mill-infrastruttura ewlenija tal-pubblikazzjoni ta’ kumpanija. It-traduzzjonijiet tiegħu, l-URLs lokalizzati, id-deċiżjonijiet tal-glossarju, u l-viżibilità tat-tiftix m'għandhomx jisparixxu meta jinbidel abbonament.",
    "A practical look at localized routes, canonical URLs, hreflang, and why stable paths matter during a migration.": "Ħarsa prattika lejn rotot lokalizzati, URLs kanoniċi, hreflang, u għaliex mogħdijiet stabbli huma importanti waqt migrazzjoni.",
    "A proven output-buffer approach for Elementor, WooCommerce, Yoast SEO, and more — with synchronous editor and email output where a background retry cannot help.": "Approċċ ippruvat ta' buffer tal-output għal Elementor, WooCommerce, Yoast SEO u oħrajn – b'editur sinkroniku u output tal-email fejn prova mill-ġdid fl-isfond ma tistax tgħin.",
    "A successful import response is only the beginning. The durable check is a readback of the stored mappings, followed by requests to the public localized pages and inspection of their canonical and alternate-language links.": "Reazzjoni ta 'importazzjoni b'suċċess hija biss il-bidu. Il-kontroll durabbli huwa readback tal-mappings maħżuna, segwit minn talbiet lill-paġni lokali lokalizzati pubbliċi u spezzjoni tal-links kanoniċi u b'lingwa alternattiva tagħhom.",
    "A universal JavaScript snippet for non-WordPress platforms is in development and not yet available. Today, the WordPress plugin above is the supported integration path — for other platforms, contact us and we will notify you as soon as the snippet ships.": "Snippet JavaScript universali għal pjattaformi li mhumiex WordPress jinsab fl-iżvilupp u għadu mhux disponibbli. Illum, il-plugin ta 'WordPress hawn fuq huwa l-mogħdija ta' integrazzjoni appoġġjata - għal pjattaformi oħra, ikkuntattjana u aħna ninnotifikawk hekk kif is-snippet jitbagħat.",
    "A URL carries meaning": "URL iġorr tifsira",
