    "Account, organization, project, translation, import/export, glossary, webhook, and related operational data are generally retained while needed to provide the account or associated project and are deleted or anonymized after deletion or a valid request unless another user still requires the organization data or a legal obligation applies. Billing and transaction records are retained for applicable statutory tax and accounting periods. Security, support, and runtime records are kept only as long as reasonably needed for their purpose. Backups can retain deleted data for a limited rotation period before overwrite. Data sent to external providers is subject to their documented retention and the customer's provider configuration.": "Kont, organizzazzjoni, proġett, traduzzjoni, importazzjoni/esportazzjoni, glossarju, webhook, u data operattiva relatata ġeneralment jinżammu waqt li jkunu meħtieġa biex jiġi pprovdut il-kont jew il-proġett assoċjat u jitħassru jew jiġu anonimizzati wara t-tħassir jew talba valida sakemm utent ieħor għadu jeħtieġ id-data tal-organizzazzjoni jew japplika obbligu legali. Ir-rekords tal-kontijiet u tat-tranżazzjonijiet jinżammu għat-taxxa statutorja applikabbli u l-perjodi tal-kontabilità. Is-sigurtà, l-appoġġ u r-rekords tal-ħin tar-runtime jinżammu biss sakemm ikun raġonevolment meħtieġ għall-iskop tagħhom. Il-backups jistgħu jżommu data mħassra għal perjodu limitat ta' rotazzjoni qabel ma jissostitwixxu. Id-dejta mibgħuta lil fornituri esterni hija soġġetta għaż-żamma dokumentata tagħhom u l-konfigurazzjoni tal-fornitur tal-klijent.",
