    "custom volume on contract.": "volum tad-dwana fuq kuntratt.",
    "Dashboard navigation": "Navigazzjoni tad-daxxbord",
    "Dashboard warnings at 90% and 100% of your monthly words, a proactive email to the organization owner, and a WordPress admin notice — you know before translations pause, not after.": "Twissijiet tad-dashboard f'90% u 100% tal-kliem tiegħek ta' kull xahar, email proattiva lis-sid tal-organizzazzjoni, u avviż tal-amministratur ta 'WordPress - taf qabel ma t-traduzzjonijiet jieqfu, mhux wara.",
    "Date": "Data",
    "Dedicated contract (DPA)": "Kuntratt iddedikat (DPA)",
    "Deepglot": "Deepglot",
    "Deepglot combines low-cost LLMs with optional premium providers while your data stays under your control.": "Deepglot jgħaqqad LLMs bi prezz baxx ma' fornituri ta' premium fakultattivi filwaqt li d-dejta tiegħek tibqa' taħt il-kontroll tiegħek.",
    "Deepglot currently uses your Gravatar. Direct uploads are not available yet.": "Deepglot bħalissa juża Gravatar tiegħek. It-uploads diretti għadhom mhumiex disponibbli.",
    "Deepglot gives you control over your translations again, with professional features at fair prices.": "Deepglot jerġa' jagħtik kontroll fuq it-traduzzjonijiet tiegħek, b'karatteristiċi professjonali bi prezzijiet ġusti.",
    "Deepglot is a software service for website translation, project administration, and WordPress integration. Self-hosted operation is also supported under the applicable software and third-party licence terms.": "Deepglot huwa servizz ta' softwer għat-traduzzjoni tal-websajt, l-amministrazzjoni tal-proġett, u l-integrazzjoni ta' WordPress. L-operazzjoni awto-ospitata hija appoġġjata wkoll taħt it-termini applikabbli tal-liċenzja tas-softwer u ta 'partijiet terzi.",
    "Deepglot is designed around that premise: translations stay accessible to the project, can be exported, and can be served from the WordPress integration without turning every page view into a new translation purchase.": "Deepglot hija mfassla madwar dik il-premessa: it-traduzzjonijiet jibqgħu aċċessibbli għall-proġett, jistgħu jiġu esportati, u jistgħu jiġu moqdija mill-integrazzjoni ta 'WordPress mingħajr ma tinbidel kull viżjoni tal-paġna f'xiri ta' traduzzjoni ġdida.",
    "Deepglot is developed in Austria. That origin now has a visible place in the product: direct language, precise interfaces, a warm architectural image, and a signal orange that is distinctly its own.": "Deepglot huwa żviluppat fl-Awstrija. Dik l-oriġini issa għandha post viżibbli fil-prodott: lingwaġġ dirett, interfaces preċiżi, immaġni arkitettonika sħuna, u oranġjo sinjal li huwa distintament tiegħu.",
    "Deepglot provides project configuration, translation caching, glossaries, import and export, webhooks, visual editing, and WordPress runtime integration. Machine translation can be incomplete or inaccurate. You must review translations before using them for legal, medical, safety-critical, regulated, or other high-risk purposes. We may maintain, update, or replace technical components while preserving the agreed core service.": "Deepglot jipprovdi konfigurazzjoni tal-proġett, caching ta' traduzzjoni, glossarji, importazzjoni u esportazzjoni, webhooks, editjar viżwali, u integrazzjoni tar-runtime ta' WordPress. It-traduzzjoni awtomatika tista' tkun inkompleta jew mhux preċiża. Int trid tirrevedi t-traduzzjonijiet qabel tużahom għal skopijiet legali, mediċi, kritiċi għas-sikurezza, regolati, jew għal skopijiet oħra ta' riskju għoli. Nistgħu nżommu, naġġornaw jew nissostitwixxu komponenti tekniċi filwaqt li nippreservaw is-servizz ewlieni miftiehem.",
    "Deepglot signs every delivery with a timestamp and HMAC signature.": "Deepglot jiffirma kull konsenja b'timestamp u firma HMAC.",
    "Deepglot support is available Monday to Friday from 9 a.m. to 5 p.m.": "L-appoġġ Deepglot huwa disponibbli mit-Tnejn sal-Ġimgħa mid-9 a.m. sal-5 p.m.",
    "Deepglot supports a self-hosted deployment path to reduce cloud lock-in. Unless a separate managed-services agreement applies, the self-hosting operator is responsible for infrastructure, database, backups, security updates, email, payment and translation-provider configuration, lawful processing, and third-party charges. Availability or support for third-party and self-hosted systems is not part of the hosted subscription merely because integration documentation is provided.": "Deepglot jappoġġja mogħdija ta' skjerament self-hosted biex tnaqqas il-lock-in tal-cloud. Sakemm ma japplikax ftehim separat ta' servizzi ġestiti, l-operatur ta' self-hosting huwa responsabbli għall-infrastruttura, id-database, il-backups, l-aġġornamenti tas-sigurtà, l-email, il-ħlas u l-konfigurazzjoni tal-fornitur tat-traduzzjoni, l-ipproċessar legali, u ħlasijiet ta' partijiet terzi. Id-disponibbiltà jew l-appoġġ għal sistemi ta’ partijiet terzi u awto-ospitati mhumiex parti mill-abbonament ospitat sempliċement minħabba li tiġi pprovduta dokumentazzjoni ta’ integrazzjoni.",
    "Deepglot translates your WordPress content automatically with AI at a fraction of the usual cost. Your translations stay yours.": "Deepglot jittraduċi l-kontenut WordPress tiegħek awtomatikament b'AI bi frazzjoni tal-ispiża tas-soltu. It-traduzzjonijiet tiegħek jibqgħu tiegħek.",
    "DeepL translation API. No model id is needed.": "API tat-traduzzjoni DeepL. L-ebda mudell id mhu meħtieġ.",
    "Default: gpt-5-mini for best cost/quality. Pro/flagship models like gpt-5.5 are opt-in.": "Default: gpt-5-mini għall-aħjar spiża/kwalità. Mudelli Pro/flagship bħal gpt-5.5 huma opt-in.",
