    "Different sites need different translation models, cost profiles, and data boundaries. Deepglot supports multiple providers and compatible gateways so the publishing workflow is not welded to one model vendor.": "Siti differenti jeħtieġu mudelli ta’ traduzzjoni differenti, profili ta’ spejjeż, u konfini tad-dejta. Deepglot jappoġġja fornituri multipli u gateways kompatibbli sabiex il-fluss tax-xogħol tal-pubblikazzjoni ma jiġix iwweldjat ma' bejjiegħ mudell wieħed.",
