    "Only fresh provider-billed words consume monthly quota. A 402 means quota exhaustion; a 429 includes Retry-After for request or fresh-word velocity limits.": "Il-kliem frisk bil-kontijiet tal-fornitur biss jikkunsmaw kwota ta' kull xahar. A 402 tfisser eżawriment tal-kwota; a 429 jinkludi Retry-After għal talba jew limiti ta 'veloċità kelma friska.",
    "Only project managers can add or remove languages. You can open the URL view for each language.": "Il-maniġers tal-proġett biss jistgħu jżidu jew ineħħu l-lingwi. Tista' tiftaħ il-vista tal-URL għal kull lingwa.",
