    "Regional character does not mean decorating every screen with clichés. It means being specific about who builds the product, where responsibility sits, and how customers can reach the people behind it.": "Il-karattru reġjonali ma jfissirx li jżejjen kull skrin bi clichés. Ifisser li tkun speċifiku dwar min jibni l-prodott, fejn tinsab ir-responsabbiltà, u kif il-klijenti jistgħu jilħqu n-nies warajh.",
    "Registration failed": "Ir-reġistrazzjoni falliet",
