    "Remove": "Neħħi",
    "Remove passkey?": "Neħħi passkey?",
    "Removing languages and bulk actions are not available here yet. You can add target languages or open the URL view for each language.": "It-tneħħija tal-lingwi u l-azzjonijiet bl-ingrossa għadhom mhumiex disponibbli hawn. Tista 'żżid lingwi fil-mira jew tiftaħ il-veduta tal-URL għal kull lingwa.",
    "Render the language switcher as an expandable dropdown.": "Agħti l-iswiċċjar tal-lingwa bħala dropdown espansibbli.",
    "Reopen": "Iftaħ mill-ġdid",
    "Replacing another translation system should not force a site to abandon URLs that have already been indexed or shared. Existing localized paths need to be inventoried, imported, and verified before traffic moves.": "Is-sostituzzjoni ta' sistema ta' traduzzjoni oħra m'għandhiex iġġiegħel sit jabbanduna URLs li diġà ġew indiċjati jew kondiviżi. Il-mogħdijiet lokalizzati eżistenti jeħtieġ li jiġu inventarji, importati, u verifikati qabel ma jiċċaqlaq it-traffiku.",
