    "Sign in securely with your device, fingerprint, or face recognition. Password and connected-provider login remain available.": "Idħol b'mod sigur bit-tagħmir tiegħek, il-marki tas-swaba' jew ir-rikonoxximent tal-wiċċ. Il-password u l-login tal-fornitur konness jibqgħu disponibbli.",
