    "Translates a batch of strings through the configured project provider while honoring cache, glossary, bot, quota, and velocity rules.": "Tittraduċi lott ta' kordi permezz tal-fornitur tal-proġett konfigurat filwaqt li jonora r-regoli tal-cache, glossarju, bot, kwota u veloċità.",
