    "A clear place of origin": "Jasno mesto izvora",
    "A multilingual website becomes part of a company’s core publishing infrastructure. Its translations, localized URLs, glossary decisions, and search visibility should not disappear when a subscription changes.": "Večjezično spletno mesto postane del osrednje založniške infrastrukture podjetja. Njegovi prevodi, lokalizirani URL-ji, odločitve glede glosarja in vidnost pri iskanju ne smejo izginiti, ko se naročnina spremeni.",
    "A practical look at localized routes, canonical URLs, hreflang, and why stable paths matter during a migration.": "Praktični pogled na lokalizirane poti, kanonične URL-je, hreflang in zakaj so stabilne poti pomembne med selitvijo.",
    "A proven output-buffer approach for Elementor, WooCommerce, Yoast SEO, and more — with synchronous editor and email output where a background retry cannot help.": "Preizkušen pristop izhodnega medpomnilnika za Elementor, WooCommerce, Yoast SEO in druge – s sinhronim urejevalnikom in izpisom e-pošte, kjer ponovni poskus v ozadju ne more pomagati.",
    "A successful import response is only the beginning. The durable check is a readback of the stored mappings, followed by requests to the public localized pages and inspection of their canonical and alternate-language links.": "Uspešen odziv na uvoz je šele začetek. Trajno preverjanje je ponovno branje shranjenih preslikav, ki mu sledijo zahteve za javne lokalizirane strani in pregled njihovih kanoničnih povezav in povezav v drugih jezikih.",
    "A universal JavaScript snippet for non-WordPress platforms is in development and not yet available. Today, the WordPress plugin above is the supported integration path — for other platforms, contact us and we will notify you as soon as the snippet ships.": "Univerzalni delček JavaScript za platforme, ki niso WordPress, je v razvoju in še ni na voljo. Danes je zgornji vtičnik WordPress podprta integracijska pot — za druge platforme nas kontaktirajte in obvestili vas bomo takoj, ko bo delček odposlan.",
    "A URL carries meaning": "URL nosi pomen",
