    "Dashboard navigation": "Navigacija na nadzorni plošči",
    "Dashboard warnings at 90% and 100% of your monthly words, a proactive email to the organization owner, and a WordPress admin notice — you know before translations pause, not after.": "Opozorila na nadzorni plošči pri 90 % in 100 % vaših mesečnih besed, proaktivno e-poštno sporočilo lastniku organizacije in obvestilo skrbnika WordPressa – veste, preden se prevodi ustavijo, ne pozneje.",
    "Date": "Datum",
    "Dedicated contract (DPA)": "Namenska pogodba (DPA)",
    "Deepglot": "Deepglot",
    "Deepglot combines low-cost LLMs with optional premium providers while your data stays under your control.": "Deepglot združuje nizkocenovne študije LLM z izbirnimi vrhunskimi ponudniki, medtem ko vaši podatki ostanejo pod vašim nadzorom.",
    "Deepglot currently uses your Gravatar. Direct uploads are not available yet.": "Deepglot trenutno uporablja vaš Gravatar. Neposredno nalaganje še ni na voljo.",
    "Deepglot gives you control over your translations again, with professional features at fair prices.": "Deepglot vam ponovno omogoča nadzor nad vašimi prevodi s profesionalnimi funkcijami po poštenih cenah.",
    "Deepglot is a software service for website translation, project administration, and WordPress integration. Self-hosted operation is also supported under the applicable software and third-party licence terms.": "Deepglot je programska storitev za prevajanje spletnih strani, administracijo projektov in integracijo WordPressa. Samostojno delovanje je podprto tudi v skladu z veljavno programsko opremo in licenčnimi pogoji tretjih oseb.",
    "Deepglot is designed around that premise: translations stay accessible to the project, can be exported, and can be served from the WordPress integration without turning every page view into a new translation purchase.": "Deepglot je zasnovan na tej predpostavki: prevodi ostanejo dostopni projektu, jih je mogoče izvoziti in jih je mogoče servirati iz integracije WordPressa, ne da bi vsak ogled strani spremenil v nov nakup prevoda.",
    "Deepglot is developed in Austria. That origin now has a visible place in the product: direct language, precise interfaces, a warm architectural image, and a signal orange that is distinctly its own.": "Deepglot je razvit v Avstriji. Ta izvor ima zdaj vidno mesto v izdelku: neposreden jezik, natančni vmesniki, topla arhitekturna podoba in signalna oranžna, ki je izrazito samosvoja.",
    "Deepglot provides project configuration, translation caching, glossaries, import and export, webhooks, visual editing, and WordPress runtime integration. Machine translation can be incomplete or inaccurate. You must review translations before using them for legal, medical, safety-critical, regulated, or other high-risk purposes. We may maintain, update, or replace technical components while preserving the agreed core service.": "Deepglot zagotavlja konfiguracijo projekta, predpomnjenje prevodov, glosarje, uvoz in izvoz, webhooks, vizualno urejanje in integracijo izvajalnega okolja WordPress. Strojno prevajanje je lahko nepopolno ali netočno. Prevode morate pregledati, preden jih uporabite za pravne, medicinske, varnostno pomembne, regulirane namene ali druge visoko tvegane namene. Lahko vzdržujemo, posodabljamo ali zamenjamo tehnične komponente, medtem ko ohranjamo dogovorjeno osnovno storitev.",
    "Deepglot signs every delivery with a timestamp and HMAC signature.": "Deepglot vsako dostavo podpiše s časovnim žigom in podpisom HMAC.",
    "Deepglot support is available Monday to Friday from 9 a.m. to 5 p.m.": "Podpora Deepglot je na voljo od ponedeljka do petka od 9. do 17. ure.",
    "Deepglot supports a self-hosted deployment path to reduce cloud lock-in. Unless a separate managed-services agreement applies, the self-hosting operator is responsible for infrastructure, database, backups, security updates, email, payment and translation-provider configuration, lawful processing, and third-party charges. Availability or support for third-party and self-hosted systems is not part of the hosted subscription merely because integration documentation is provided.": "Deepglot podpira samostojno gostujočo pot uvajanja za zmanjšanje zaklenjenosti v oblak. Razen če velja ločena pogodba o upravljanih storitvah, je operater samostojnega gostovanja odgovoren za infrastrukturo, bazo podatkov, varnostne kopije, varnostne posodobitve, e-pošto, konfiguracijo ponudnika plačil in prevajanja, zakonito obdelavo in stroške tretjih oseb. Razpoložljivost ali podpora za sisteme tretjih oseb in sisteme, ki gostujejo sami, ni del gostujoče naročnine samo zato, ker je zagotovljena integracijska dokumentacija.",
    "Deepglot translates your WordPress content automatically with AI at a fraction of the usual cost. Your translations stay yours.": "Deepglot samodejno prevede vašo vsebino WordPress z AI za delček običajne cene. Vaši prevodi ostanejo vaši.",
    "DeepL translation API. No model id is needed.": "API za prevajanje DeepL. ID modela ni potreben.",
    "Default: gpt-5-mini for best cost/quality. Pro/flagship models like gpt-5.5 are opt-in.": "Privzeto: gpt-5-mini za najboljšo ceno/kakovost. Pro/glavni modeli, kot je gpt-5.5, so opt-in.",
