    "Features": "Lastnosti",
    "Fill out this information to improve automatic translations. Your website type and industry help us adapt translations to your use case.": "Izpolnite te podatke, da izboljšate samodejne prevode. Vrsta vašega spletnega mesta in panoga nam pomagata prilagoditi prevode vašemu primeru uporabe.",
    "First name": "Ime",
    "First-time visitors can optionally be redirected from Accept-Language.": "Prvi obiskovalci so lahko po želji preusmerjeni iz Accept-Language.",
    "Flag style": "Slog zastave",
    "for brands with a professional presence.": "za blagovne znamke s profesionalno prisotnostjo.",
    "for growing online shops and blogs.": "za rast spletnih trgovin in blogov.",
    "For local and preview testing you can sign in directly as the shared test user.": "Za lokalno in predogledno testiranje se lahko prijavite neposredno kot skupni testni uporabnik.",
    "For Ollama/local gateways, the Vercel runtime must be able to reach the base URL. localhost on your laptop is not reachable from production.": "Za Ollama/lokalne prehode mora imeti izvajalno okolje Vercel možnost doseči osnovni URL. localhost na vašem prenosniku ni dosegljiv iz proizvodnje.",
    "For paid subscriptions, Stripe processes customer, checkout, payment-method, invoice, subscription, tax, and transaction data. Deepglot stores Stripe customer, subscription and price references, plan status, billing address details needed by the product, and quota information; Deepglot does not receive full card numbers. We process support messages and related technical context to answer requests. Contract performance and pre-contract steps are the main legal basis; tax, accounting, and other statutory records are processed to meet legal obligations.": "Za plačljive naročnine Stripe obdeluje podatke o strankah, blagajni, načinu plačila, računu, naročnini, davku in transakcijah. Deepglot shranjuje podatke o strankah Stripe, naročninah in cenah, status paketa, podrobnosti naslova za izstavitev računa, ki jih potrebuje izdelek, in informacije o kvotah; Deepglot ne prejme polnih številk kartic. Obdelujemo sporočila podpore in s tem povezani tehnični kontekst, da odgovorimo na zahteve. Izvedba pogodbe in predpogodbeni koraki so glavna pravna podlaga; davčne, računovodske in druge zakonske evidence obdelujejo za izpolnjevanje zakonskih obveznosti.",
    "for scaling e-commerce platforms.": "za povečanje platform za e-trgovino.",
