    "Regional character does not mean decorating every screen with clichés. It means being specific about who builds the product, where responsibility sits, and how customers can reach the people behind it.": "Regionalni značaj ne pomeni okraševanja vsakega zaslona s klišeji. To pomeni natančno določiti, kdo izdeluje izdelek, kje je odgovornost in kako lahko stranke dosežejo ljudi, ki stojijo za njim.",
