    "Translate search": "Iskanje prevodov",
    "Translate WordPress with modern AI, transparent pricing and no subscription lock-in.": "Prevedite WordPress s sodobnim AI, preglednimi cenami in brez zaklepanja naročnine.",
    "Translate your content quickly and privately without cloud lock-in.": "Hitro in zasebno prevedite svojo vsebino brez zaklepanja v oblak.",
    "Translate your WordPress site with modern AI providers, keep your own data, and launch multilingual pages without cloud lock-in.": "Prevedite svoje spletno mesto WordPress s sodobnimi ponudniki umetne inteligence, obdržite svoje podatke in zaženite večjezične strani brez zaklepanja v oblak.",
