    "Translates a batch of strings through the configured project provider while honoring cache, glossary, bot, quota, and velocity rules.": "Prevaja paket nizov prek konfiguriranega ponudnika projekta, pri tem pa upošteva predpomnilnik, glosar, bot, kvoto in pravila hitrosti.",
