    "Weekly activity digest": "Tedenski pregled aktivnosti",
    "Weekly digest disabled": "Tedenski pregled onemogočen",
    "Weekly digest enabled": "Tedenski izvleček omogočen",
    "Welcome back": "dobrodošli nazaj",
    "What are you building?": "Kaj gradiš?",
    "What is your website about?": "O čem govori vaša spletna stran?",
    "What you get with page views:": "Kaj dobite z ogledi strani:",
    "When enabled, Deepglot detects and translates content automatically. When disabled, you approve detected content manually.": "Ko je omogočen, Deepglot samodejno zazna in prevede vsebino. Ko je onemogočeno, zaznano vsebino odobrite ročno.",
    "When you add a passkey, we store its credential identifier, public key, signature counter, device type, backup status, and connection-transport metadata to authenticate your account. Private keys and biometric data remain on your authenticator and are never received or stored by Deepglot.": "Ko dodate Passkey, za preverjanje pristnosti računa shranimo njegov identifikator, javni ključ, števec podpisov, vrsto naprave, stanje varnostnega kopiranja in metapodatke povezave. Zasebni ključi in biometrični podatki ostanejo v vašem avtentikatorju, Deepglot pa jih nikoli ne prejme ali shrani.",
    "Why multilingual publishing should leave your content, routes, and provider choices under your control.": "Zakaj bi moralo večjezično založništvo pustiti vašo vsebino, poti in izbiro ponudnika pod vašim nadzorom.",
    "Without https://, e.g. example.com or sub.example.com": "Brez https://, npr. example.com ali sub.example.com",
    "without subscription lock-in": "brez naročniškega zaklepanja",
    "WooCommerce and wp_mail emails follow the runtime configuration stored in the plugin.": "E-poštna sporočila WooCommerce in wp_mail sledijo konfiguraciji časa izvajanja, shranjeni v vtičniku.",
    "Word type t follows the plugin contract. Human traffic uses bot=0; every bot value >=1 is cache-only and never invokes a provider.": "Besedna vrsta t sledi pogodbi o vtičniku. Človeški promet uporablja bot=0; vsaka vrednost bota >=1 je samo predpomnilnik in nikoli ne prikliče ponudnika.",
    "Word usage": "Besedna raba",
    "Word usage by project": "Besedna raba po projektu",
    "WordPress engineering": "WordPress inženiring",
    "WordPress is the source of truth for runtime settings": "WordPress je vir resnice za nastavitve časa izvajanja",
    "WordPress plugin": "WordPress vtičnik",
    "WordPress Plugin": "Vtičnik WordPress",
    "WordPress settings": "Nastavitve WordPressa",
    "WordPress translation without subscription lock-in": "Prevajanje WordPress brez zaklepanja naročnine",
    "WordPress-first plugin": "WordPress-prvi vtičnik",
    "Words": "Besede",
    "words / month": "besed / mesec",
    "Workspace": "Delovni prostor",
    "Workspace creation and management will appear here once persistence for those actions is implemented.": "Ustvarjanje in upravljanje delovnega prostora se bo pojavilo tukaj, ko bo vztrajnost za ta dejanja implementirana.",
    "Workspace default": "Privzeti delovni prostor",
    "Wrong email address or password": "Napačen e-poštni naslov ali geslo",
    "Yearly": "Letno",
    "You can cancel a paid subscription through the available cancellation control or Stripe billing portal. Cancellation is scheduled for the end of the current paid billing period; the paid plan normally remains active until then. Statutory cancellation, withdrawal, and refund rights remain unaffected. Cancelling a subscription does not itself delete the account or project data. Export required data before deleting a project or account and contact support if the in-product flow is unavailable.": "Plačljivo naročnino lahko prekličete prek razpoložljivega nadzora preklica ali portala za obračunavanje Stripe. Preklic je predviden ob koncu tekočega plačanega obračunskega obdobja; plačani načrt običajno ostane aktiven do takrat. Zakonske pravice do preklica, odstopa in povračila ostanejo nespremenjene. Preklic naročnine sam po sebi ne izbriše računa ali podatkov o projektu. Pred brisanjem projekta ali računa izvozite zahtevane podatke in se obrnite na podporo, če tok v izdelku ni na voljo.",
    "You have been invited to collaborate on a Deepglot project.": "Povabljeni ste bili k sodelovanju pri projektu Deepglot.",
    "You must provide accurate registration information, keep credentials and API keys secure, and use the service only for lawful content for which you hold the necessary rights. You are responsible for users, websites, webhook destinations, and provider credentials connected to your organization. Automated abuse, attempts to bypass quotas or rate limits, and interference with the service are prohibited.": "Zagotoviti morate točne podatke o registraciji, skrbeti za varnost poverilnic in ključev API ter uporabljati storitev samo za zakonito vsebino, za katero imate potrebne pravice. Odgovorni ste za uporabnike, spletna mesta, cilje webhook in poverilnice ponudnika, povezane z vašo organizacijo. Avtomatizirane zlorabe, poskusi obhoda kvot ali omejitev hitrosti in poseganje v storitev so prepovedani.",
    "You receive this email because the weekly digest is enabled for this workspace.": "To e-poštno sporočilo ste prejeli, ker je za ta delovni prostor omogočen tedenski izvleček.",
    "You requested to reset your Deepglot password.": "Zahtevali ste ponastavitev gesla za Deepglot.",
    "You retain rights in content submitted to Deepglot and grant us the limited permission needed to process, store, translate, transmit, and return it for the service. Depending on project settings, translation content is sent to the selected translation provider or customer-specified compatible endpoint. You must ensure that this processing and any uploaded provider API key are permitted for your content and users.": "Pridržujete pravice do vsebine, poslane Deepglot, in nam dajete omejeno dovoljenje, potrebno za obdelavo, shranjevanje, prevajanje, prenos in vračilo za storitev. Odvisno od nastavitev projekta se vsebina prevoda pošlje izbranemu ponudniku prevoda ali združljivi končni točki, ki jo določi stranka. Zagotoviti morate, da sta ta obdelava in vsi naloženi ključi API ponudnika dovoljeni za vašo vsebino in uporabnike.",
    "you@example.com": "vi@example.com",
    "Your current plan is:": "Vaš trenutni načrt je:",
    "Your data, your control": "Vaši podatki, vaš nadzor",
    "Your Deepglot weekly digest – {organization}": "Vaš Deepglot tedenski povzetek – {organization}",
    "Your languages. Your content. Your control.": "Vaši jeziki. Vaša vsebina. Vaš nadzor.",
    "Your plan will remain active until the end of the current billing period. After that, you will be moved back to the Free plan.": "Vaš načrt bo ostal aktiven do konca trenutnega obračunskega obdobja. Po tem boste prestavljeni nazaj na brezplačen načrt."
