    "Glossary rules": "Ordlista regler",
    "Glossary rules are protected before provider translation. Manual translations still take precedence.": "Ordlistasregler är skyddade före leverantörens översättning. Manuella översättningar har fortfarande företräde.",
    "Here is your activity from the last complete week.": "Här är din aktivitet från den senaste hela veckan.",
    "Here is your Deepglot weekly activity digest.": "Här är din Deepglot veckoaktivitetssammanfattning.",
    "High-quality translations powered by current OpenAI models by default, with OpenRouter, Ollama, OpenAI-compatible gateways, and optional DeepL support.": "Högkvalitativa översättningar som drivs av nuvarande OpenAI-modeller som standard, med OpenRouter, Ollama, OpenAI-kompatibla gateways och valfritt DeepL-stöd.",
    "How regional identity and multilingual ambition can strengthen each other in one product experience.": "Hur regional identitet och flerspråkig ambition kan stärka varandra i en produktupplevelse.",
    "Human review": "Mänsklig recension",
    "Human Review": "Mänsklig recension",
    "Ideas for an open, multilingual web.": "Idéer för en öppen, flerspråkig webb.",
    "Idempotency-Key is optional. Success and deterministic responses can be replayed for up to 24 hours without repeating side effects. A retryable 429 is deduplicated and replayed only for its bounded Retry-After window; after that, the same key starts a new execution. A different body returns 409 only while the record is retained.": "Idempotency-Key is optional. Success and deterministic responses can be replayed for up to 24 hours without repeating side effects. A retryable 429 is deduplicated and replayed only for its bounded Retry-After window; after that, the same key starts a new execution. A different body returns 409 only while the record is retained.",
